  "description": "Barcode C# library on Microsoft PowerPoint document: The nuget package includes APIs to encode, generate, read, scan QR Code, Code 128, and other barcodes on Microsoft PowerPoint file in ASP.NET, MVC, web, Windows desktop apps.\n\nSupported barcode formats :\n* QR Code (Styled QR Code, GS1 compatible), Data Matrix (GS1 compatible), PDF-417\n* Code 39, Code 128\n* EAN 8, EAN 13, UPC-A, UPC-E\n* GS1-128, GS1 DataBar, ITF-14\n* And more\n\nBarcode Output Types :\n* Document : Microsoft PowerPoint \n* Raster images: BITMAP (.bmp), JPEG, PNG, TIFF, GIF\n* Vector images: SVG, EPS\n* Stream or Byte array objects\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6.1\n\nOnline Guides :\n* Developer Guide : https://www.barcodelib.com/csharp/\n* Contact US : support@barcodelib.com",
